@startuml
title Challenges Page — Загрузка списка и тем

actor User
participant "ChallengesPage" as Page
participant "ChallengeController" as CC
participant "Challenge" as Challenge
participant "Topic" as Topic

User -> Page: открывает /challenges

Page -> CC: dispatch(getAllChallenges(page=1, pageSize, sort=newest))
CC -> Challenge: findAll(page, pageSize, sort)
Challenge --> CC: items[], total
CC --> Page: items[], total, totalPages
Page --> User: рендер списка задач

Page -> CC: dispatch(getTopics())
CC -> Topic: getTopics()
Topic --> CC: topics[]
CC --> Page: topics[]
Page --> User: рендер фильтра тем

@enduml
